  characterName: Sans
  icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 243c50d8a71d7d24e9bc538d543f30d4, type: 3}
  age: 0
  gender: 0
  birthdate: 
  appearance: He's a literal skeleton, but with personality! Hollow but expressive
    eyes, a jaw that makes a noise when he laughs, and a thunderous top hat that
    he never takes off. He wears an old jacket with patches and a poorly tied tie.
    He has some "fake muscles" painted on with chalk for fun.
  personalityTraits: 1500000009000000
  motivations: Make everyone laugh, especially those who are afraid of death.
  background: "No one really knows how Sans \u201Clived,\u201D but he says he died
    laughing at a joke so bad that it left him with a boner. The truth is that he
    was a minstrel many years ago, and after he died, some kind of magic kept him
    alive (never better said). Now he travels the world putting on improvised shows,
    sneaking into taverns, and causing laughter (or groans) with his boner jokes.\r\n\r\nHe
    has a special relationship with the dead of the world: he says he talks to them
    often, and they tell him secrets\u2026 but you never know if he\u2019s serious
    or if it\u2019s just part of his show."
  speechStyle: 3
  otherInfo: He likes to spend time with Tikkle because he feels reflected in her
    as he is also a monster.
